Description:
Looking only for the secondary index on the same data will give an incorrect result. The root cause was not identified, but it may be related to the following factors:

1. Character set. If the table does not specify a character set of UTF8MB4, this is not triggered.
2. Long transaction. There must be a long transaction to block the purge process.
3. Secondary index. There is no error if the query is by primary key index.

Or for some other unknown reason.

