My test method is to use MTR execution, then stop in the end. 

You can see that the query ("select id from foo_t force index(schema_id) where name like 'name_670'") cannot get a correct result by checking the log of the test case (which might be placed in 'mysql-test/var/log/XXXXX.LOG', XXXXX is the name of the test case.)

